  "description": "Emergency backoffice access for Umbraco 17 and 18: a configured administrator password that also unlocks the account and removes its two-factor enrolment, and an optional debug sign-in that accepts any nonempty password and bypasses lockout and two-factor checks. Debug sign-in is off by default and requires both BreakGlass:DebugSignIn and Umbraco:CMS:Hosting:Debug to be true. Registers automatically through a composer.",
